But four people isn't enough for Among Us, so I'm thinking we'd need a lot more people.

2889
01:50:16,376 --> 01:50:18,376
でもやりたいこといっぱいあるな。
Still, there's so much I want to do.

2890
01:50:18,776 --> 01:50:19,976
いっぱいあるのじゃ。
So much-noja.

2891
01:50:20,576 --> 01:50:21,376
うん。
Yeah.

2892
01:50:21,976 --> 01:50:22,976
うん、うん。
Yeah, yeah.

2893
01:50:23,576 --> 01:50:25,176
ガチのホラゲやって。
"Play a seriously scary horror game."

2894
01:50:25,176 --> 01:50:27,176
え、わしが今までやってきたのガチじゃないの？
Wait, the ones I've played so far aren't serious?

2895
01:50:27,376 --> 01:50:29,676
お主らの思うガチのホラゲって何？
What do you all consider a seriously scary horror game?

2896
01:50:29,776 --> 01:50:34,376
でもさ、まだ初心者向けホラゲしかやったことないさ、あちちめらがさ、
But you know, Atsuchi Mela has only ever played beginner-friendly horror games...

2897
01:50:34,376 --> 01:50:37,376
ガチのホラゲなんかやったら失神しちゃうんじゃない？
...so if I play a hardcore horror game, won't I pass out?

2898
01:50:37,476 --> 01:50:38,676
大丈夫？
Will I be okay?

2899
01:50:39,176 --> 01:50:40,776
ちょっとまずいんじゃない？
Isn't that a bit risky?

2900
01:50:41,676 --> 01:50:42,376
うん。
Hmm.

2901
01:50:42,576 --> 01:50:44,676
JSPでもガチで怖い？
